  "goodToKnow": "Schlechthin means par excellence, the quintessential example: Paris ist die Stadt der Liebe schlechthin. It comes after the noun. It can also mean simply or absolutely: schlechthin unmöglich. Despite the look, it has nothing to do with schlecht (bad): schlecht originally meant plain or simple, a meaning preserved in schlicht. Synonyms: par excellence, schlechtweg, schlichtweg."
